githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/commit/7970dbf816bb37d2a8331d5725070cd47138fe81","node_id":"C_kwDOPocQ3toAKDc5NzBkYmY4MTZiYjM3ZDJhODMzMWQ1NzI1MDcwY2Q0NzEzOGZlODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/commit/88676f03b4929532a8ed034feac44a42ca2840c3","sha":"88676f03b4929532a8ed034feac44a42ca2840c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/commits/88676f03b4929532a8ed034feac44a42ca2840c3"}],"sha":"7970dbf816bb37d2a8331d5725070cd47138fe81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/commits/7970dbf816bb37d2a8331d5725070cd47138fe81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35806222?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elishabantana","id":35806222,"login":"elishabantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODA2MjIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elishabantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/commits/88676f03b4929532a8ed034feac44a42ca2840c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-01T19:17:50Z","email":"35806222+elishabantana@users.noreply.github.com","name":"elishabantana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-01T19:17:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(feat) Bump `@carbon/react` to v1.76.0 (#1215)\n\n* (chore) Bump @carbon/react to v1.76.0\n\n* Bump @carbon/charts\n\n* Bump icons-react and merge everything\n\n* Remove FAB tooltips and custom modal close button logic\n\nThese changes include:\n\n- Removing tooltips from the devtools trigger button and help menu button. Since these buttons are fixed to the screen, their tooltip popovers require custom CSS for proper positioning. This workaround is hacky and not ideal. For now, I''ve removed the tooltips entirely, eliminating the need for the custom CSS. While this isn''t great for a11y, it''s a temporary measure.\n\n- Removing the logic that appends a close button to the modal header in the modal container frame. The upstream changes in Carbon modify the modal’s DOM structure, breaking this logic. After investigating, it seems the primary benefit was localizing the close button text. We can reintroduce it if needed, but for now, removing it seems like the better approach. I’ve also added style overrides to ensure the modal frame has the correct background and hover color.\n\n- Applying SASS interpolation syntax `(#{variable})` to additional variables in the style guide.\n\n* Remove transparent background color override from DataTable\n\nRemoves a style override that was causing the background color of the DataTable to be transparent in the dark theme.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ian <ian.c.bacher@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"046c9c265671347a119e21586f0784de0ece6387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/git/trees/046c9c265671347a119e21586f0784de0ece6387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs-testdata/openmrs-esm-core/git/commits/88676f03b4929532a8ed034feac44a42ca2840c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 046c9c265671347a119e21586f0784de0ece6387\nparent b1774dd17937ee634009ed6231115dd5a7d47c4c\nauthor elishabantana <35806222+elishabantana@users.noreply.github.com> 1743535070 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1743535070 +0300\n\n(feat) Bump `@carbon/react` to v1.76.0 (#1215)\n\n* (chore) Bump @carbon/react to v1.76.0\n\n* Bump @carbon/charts\n\n* Bump icons-react and merge everything\n\n* Remove FAB tooltips and custom modal close button logic\n\nThese changes include:\n\n- Removing tooltips from the devtools trigger button and help menu button. Since these buttons are fixed to the screen, their tooltip popovers require custom CSS for proper positioning. This workaround is hacky and not ideal. For now, I''ve removed the tooltips entirely, eliminating the need for the custom CSS. While this isn''t great for a11y, it''s a temporary measure.\n\n- Removing the logic that appends a close button to the modal header in the modal container frame. The upstream changes in Carbon modify the modal’s DOM structure, breaking this logic. After investigating, it seems the primary benefit was localizing the close button text. We can reintroduce it if needed, but for now, removing it seems like the better approach. I’ve also added style overrides to ensure the modal frame has the correct background and hover color.\n\n- Applying SASS interpolation syntax `(#{variable})` to additional variables in the style guide.\n\n* Remove transparent background color override from DataTable\n\nRemoves a style override that was causing the background color of the DataTable to be transparent in the dark theme.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ian <ian.c.bacher@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn7DveCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOEMQAD6OA5jzITILPR7/Wjh0gLhB\nFXhcq5pkpVUPyDfHMmqvfJdOvqQ2uJ8boFoinKEQRfIGcpotxAQ1//HyYwqt+Zjx\n1eXGCH8H/tmIP2rhlfTQdP5r8Vd2Lmly00XwajvohAugkcIggaa98tfotmk2SaC9\n3++HtQgNI9QiWBunDl9Qg8u/IWakOMsDJwGENiZUTK4pSQfzfKIMCr9bfURiWvfX\ngpn5nw79smk9NJRjQL/Uuw9+O6xlL8KQfmMS2D1/OOsLSfOOTQUg/qQNnlxQ4CQp\nvS5gxP+U26q99S8aMxPepKQsZGrJOMLT7/et1aV+E/uDVOz61sVmwagtvjimpGEu\naSvv3WL9k5Y5KdUZNSA+xtmnHIuGPIRukG6YyWRJKXTMfaV/o6KBwEdQJZb3vPVi\nDoWZu4kgDMcrDZVaiSUvQaEWJP74uZEJuqQDwbaXwhyinMSw/0Q3iMjOjgpSX4u0\nvXA1vRjQ9oqBkb/ES3cdYVsJKRMo97nSSPjyeQ94CO3hWL/A/uAFLs8Y3Yl7N/+x\nsvMldg0D+cfZUianW8g8vBGRjvCP0KL3azRUKAFFHtMx6mjkV/WVCbeVbEi18CbZ\nadtelRagkZIiUlxJbBI1Fz+TRnBKOxYtoGlUq3XW96eKvaDZ0Cotgw7YXUpqmZ7I\nQORf4wPCwW1dx1fu7RMZ\n=U0vk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-09-02T11:57:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/org