ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T11:26:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GH-19: [Performance] Cache Integration and Streamline API Calls (#130)\n\n* Add caching mechanism skeleton with multiple backends\n\n* Add SingleFlight class for cache stampede protection\n\n* Add Redis caching support with configuration options in .env and docker-compose. Implement cache lifecycle management in main application and integrate Redis backend for caching operations.\n\n* Refactor cache management to support connection and closure for Redis\n\n* Add tests for cache behaviour\n\n* Update cache connection logic to fail-open on Redis errors\n\n* Change ttl to 7 days with jitter\n\n* Refactor TTL jitter documentation in cache module\n\n* Refactor code formatting and improve readability across multiple files\n\n* Update Redis service binding in docker-compose to restrict access to localhost\n\n* Add healthcheck for Redis service in docker-compose and ensure gi-service depends on healthy Redis\n\n* Enhance lifespan management in FastAPI app to ensure proper resource cleanup by using a try-finally block for cache and HTTP client closure.\n\n* Implement Redis lock management with unique owner tokens and Lua script for atomic release in SingleFlight class\n\n* Refactor error message in OpenGIN service and improve cache environment variable handling; update test for Redis connection failure\n\n* Refactor attributes_key function to simplify key generation by removing datasetName and categoryId from the key format; enhance SingleFlight class to prevent cancellation of shared futures\n\n* Enhance SingleFlight class to continuously poll for cache while waiting for Redis lock\n\n* Fix formatting\n\n* Implement blocking connection pool in RedisCache class\n\n* Refactor Redis client binding in SingleFlight class\n\n* Add read-through caching decorators and update OpenGIN service methods\n\n* Refactor caching mechanism by introducing cache decorators and updating OpenGIN service methods to utilize them\n\n* Update Docker configuration to support Redis caching; add Makefile for simplified commands and modify .env.example for local development\n\n* Refactor caching decorators by consolidating `cache_list` and `cache_value` into a single `cached` decorator\n\n* Fix formatting\n\n* Add choreo specific dockerfile\n\n* Update Makefile commands for consistency and correct README instructions\n\n* Update .env.example","tree":{"sha":"4848f8ea73a8c4becbc14ea690aeac70647f55ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LDFLK/GI-SERVICE/git/trees/4848f8ea73a8c4becbc14ea690aeac70647f55ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LDFLK/GI-SERVICE/git/commits/86b2cd1b36c45f938a37720bfac8b60503b66aaa","verification":{"payload":"tree 4848f8ea73a8c4becbc14ea690aeac70647f55ff\nparent eb711561e18154ee3ed109ab7a404d4c0dcb3c4b\nauthor Zaeema Nashath <96104978+zaeema-n@users.noreply.github.com> 1787311578 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787311578 +0530\n\nGH-19: [Performance] Cache Integration and Streamline API Calls (#130)\n\n* Add caching mechanism skeleton with multiple backends\n\n* Add SingleFlight class for cache stampede protection\n\n* Add Redis caching support with configuration options in .env and docker-compose. Implement cache lifecycle management in main application and integrate Redis backend for caching operations.\n\n* Refactor cache management to support connection and closure for Redis\n\n* Add tests for cache behaviour\n\n* Update cache connection logic to fail-open on Redis errors\n\n* Change ttl to 7 days with jitter\n\n* Refactor TTL jitter documentation in cache module\n\n* Refactor code formatting and improve readability across multiple files\n\n* Update Redis service binding in docker-compose to restrict access to localhost\n\n* Add healthcheck for Redis service in docker-compose and ensure gi-service depends on healthy Redis\n\n* Enhance lifespan management in FastAPI app to ensure proper resource cleanup by using a try-finally block for cache and HTTP client closure.\n\n* Implement Redis lock management with unique owner tokens and Lua script for atomic release in SingleFlight class\n\n* Refactor error message in OpenGIN service and improve cache environment variable handling; update test for Redis connection failure\n\n* Refactor attributes_key function to simplify key generation by removing datasetName and categoryId from the key format; enhance SingleFlight class to prevent cancellation of shared futures\n\n* Enhance SingleFlight class to continuously poll for cache while waiting for Redis lock\n\n* Fix formatting\n\n* Implement blocking connection pool in RedisCache class\n\n* Refactor Redis client binding in SingleFlight class\n\n* Add read-through caching decorators and update OpenGIN service methods\n\n* Refactor caching mechanism by introducing cache decorators and updating OpenGIN service methods to utilize them\n\n* Update Docker configuration to support Redis caching; add Makefile for simplified commands and modify .env.example for local development\n\n* Refactor caching decorators by consolidating `cache_list` and `cache_value` into a single `cached` decorator\n\n* Fix formatting\n\n* Add choreo specific dockerfile\n\n* Update Makefile commands for consistency and correct README instructions\n\n* Update .env.example","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiDXaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW80QABf09e5Gx8+5XhQk1L3OoHTt\nNcgol6Fiq5TNURgFjg+hVY+citAx22f9ZyN/ULrsERfRm3uSg96SY4iPDf8+3BYw\nCgjHPuPVMWKga7Ls0Sj360mBPKEUS9rG8EYphtRSWto2sJRwpijaFaQZE+pMWBGJ\n/A8KpV4DF4TrLVODMXquso4f+bx+R1PINjex6z9gbHYGLDIoGngGyXxkhPepCDRz\nmmD81yPDp8aW++9IKpXgiXUVO36PwT6kJpnn+hNj+CTB9M0NY/E4QaddxWrkrQO/\nfY9wVsHZmRSF8WCSbouyE8/uIABWS3aes/79GMEuf31qWlyltszTAWTI3aIMi/Xu\n8lU9fpJpG2KibIFcN2vsgyt4vIDsX67AOh3BRps5DJvy3SEU+3xBuVavOZ6F+10O\n45QJHu4icMWt97qoq9JjRVnYB+SK7tlFmVRVJbe+rwodOPPOVUFJjHwhl0/u3NkG\nJ5s0/E5pH6m63iY2XtWsMdhqrUW80X7O3AYmYTaIO1Kt7RdQD5QJOhJcA+rfupTc\n