mmitter":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:10:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: enable auto-reconnect by default and mark intentional disconnects with aborted flag (#74)\n\n* feat(server): 主动断开连接时抛出带 aborted 标记的错误\n\n- server.js 新增 createAbortError，disconnect 中止在途握手时\n  reject 带 aborted 标记的 Error，区分正常取消与真实失败\n- connectAll 对 aborted 仅 console.debug，真实失败才 warn\n- 同步更新 CONTEXT.md、connect-server.md 文档说明\n- 新增 In-Flight Connect Abort 测试用例，验证无 unhandled rejection\n- 刷新 nos.json 签名与哈希\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix ci\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bad845865c6da4716b3c50b4efda81867e84765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/3bad845865c6da4716b3c50b4efda81867e84765"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/987e42bd248fdea90cee665cbf01696c21e52f65","verification":{"payload":"tree 3bad845865c6da4716b3c50b4efda81867e84765\nparent e19335fff4af42fc1edbabc97b122e9375db2a25\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1790003457 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790003457 +0800\n\nfeat: enable auto-reconnect by default and mark intentional disconnects with aborted flag (#74)\n\n* feat(server): 主动断开连接时抛出带 aborted 标记的错误\n\n- server.js 新增 createAbortError，disconnect 中止在途握手时\n  reject 带 aborted 标记的 Error，区分正常取消与真实失败\n- connectAll 对 aborted 仅 console.debug，真实失败才 warn\n- 同步更新 CONTEXT.md、connect-server.md 文档说明\n- 新增 In-Flight Connect Abort 测试用例，验证无 unhandled rejection\n- 刷新 nos.json 签名与哈希\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix ci\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsUkBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUUcQAH6niQLGizL8cy6ITPcWXNht\nE7kMuLaxgrxxR9pxHQ5cIMFNYRgfNpOgVF5aqpFgIPR6h8aWVS+qX19ahd0s26+P\nN4ja+Wqi/IYGzFRb+DkG9cHdWkfUq5zSBbq3CC2tWQ4vQsT0vY6HlToWxVvGI1KN\n4Ygkf4SDW7taPDkNX9tnueHOXE/9STg4VoB2U5fdXtKPEdUADLVSioBaHyMDXVFz\nBoxow9VQ