ps://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/8d2a3d043d60af7729e58e0986763ba4363efac1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:44:01Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:44:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Refactor permission handling and downgrade logic in storage (#70)\n\n* refactor(storage, fs): 优化句柄权限处理与失效降级逻辑\n\n1. 为BaseHandle新增queryPermission和requestPermission代理方法\n2. 修改fromStorable实现：句柄失效时降级返回null而非抛错，避免拖垮整个键读取\n3. 更新fs/get逻辑：挂载句柄不存在时抛出明确错误\n4. 重构checkPermission：仅查询权限不主动申请，适配无用户手势场景\n5. 调整open逻辑：在用户手势内补全缺失的目录权限\n6. 移除getMounted中冗余的权限检查\n7. 更新所有相关文档说明变更后的行为\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update storage.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6f46e1d0d0d84a076ed86fd9d38e4fc55b059b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/b6f46e1d0d0d84a076ed86fd9d38e4fc55b059b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/8d2a3d043d60af7729e58e0986763ba4363efac1","verification":{"payload":"tree b6f46e1d0d0d84a076ed86fd9d38e4fc55b059b5\nparent 1fe0c7ecf1a73ebec5a5dd281c7f188f0830f3f8\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1788885841 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788885841 +0800\n\nfeat: Refactor permission handling and downgrade logic in storage (#70)\n\n* refactor(storage, fs): 优化句柄权限处理与失效降级逻辑\n\n1. 为BaseHandle新增queryPermission和requestPermission代理方法\n2. 修改fromStorable实现：句柄失效时降级返回null而非抛错，避免拖垮整个键读取\n3. 更新fs/get逻辑：挂载句柄不存在时抛出明确错误\n4. 重构checkPermission：仅查询权限不主动申请，适配无用户手势场景\n5. 调整open逻辑：在用户手势内补全缺失的目录权限\n6. 移除getMounted中冗余的权限检查\n7. 更新所有相关文档说明变更后的行为\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update storage.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoDtRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8i4QAIPKqLQXN9vzPjNRZcNgjtbg\nbiZsm5cEdqIRrD6L4YlBaP0xkscBVN