T14:44:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Enhance dev-bridge with debugging features and CI support (#68)\n\n* feat(dev-bridge): 实现开发模式脚本注入功能\n\n新增dev-bridge开发调试能力，支持在顶层HTML导航中自动注入调试脚本，添加配套测试与文档\n\n* build(dev-bridge): 简化测试流程并优化静态服务配置\n\n1. 新增scripts/static.js同时启动3002和3003端口静态服务，废弃static:test命令\n2. 新增test:dev-bridge命令一键运行dev-bridge测试\n3. 更新文档和测试文件中的端口命令说明\n\n* ci: 新增 dev-bridge 浏览器测试 CI 作业\n\n新增独立的 Chrome 测试任务来运行 dev-bridge 独占测试，该测试需要独立 origin 和端口独占权限，通过专用 npm 脚本执行并添加端口守卫适配运行环境\n\n* feat(dev-bridge): add dev mode warning banner with tamper protection\n\n1. 新增开发模式警告横幅功能，默认开启\n2. 横幅支持拖拽持久化位置，多语言适配\n3. 实现横幅防篡改保护，移除后自动替换为警告页\n4. 更新文档与测试用例覆盖新功能\n\n* refactor(dev-bridge): 新增双重开关机制并完善防篡改逻辑\n\n1. 为dev-bridge注入逻辑新增宿主总开关DEV_BRIDGE_ENABLED\n2. 大幅优化横幅防篡改可见性判断，覆盖更多隐藏手段\n3. 更新文档与测试用例，补充未开启开关的反向测试\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update browser-tests.yml\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"992feccc6fb493fe6353b2d38db2730f8a24cdc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/992feccc6fb493fe6353b2d38db2730f8a24cdc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/ceb9e2e7ad8debba50852601ecc69638c1cd08b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 992feccc6fb493fe6353b2d38db2730f8a24cdc7\nparent 8258f10a398fc4d791f6fe9560efd50367a3ae5f\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1788101059 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788101059 +0800\n\nfeat: Enhance dev-bridge with debugging features and CI support (#68)\n\n* feat(dev-bridge): 实现开发模式脚本注入功能\n\n新增dev-bridge开发调试能力，支持在顶层HTML导航中自动注入调试脚本，添加配套测试与文档\n\n* build(dev-bridge): 简化测试流程并优化静态服务配置\n\n1. 新增scripts/static.js同时启动3002和3003端口静态服务，废弃static:test命令\n2. 新增test:dev-bridge命令一键运行dev-bridge测试\n3. 更新文档和测试文件中的端口命令说明\n\n* ci: 新增 dev-bridge 浏览器测试 CI 作业\n\n新增独立的 Chrome 测试任务来运行 dev-bridge 独占测试，该测试需要独立 origin 和端口独占权限，通过专用 npm 脚本执行并添加端口守卫适配运行环境\n\n* feat(dev-bridge): add dev mode warning banner with tamper protection\n\n1. 新增开发模式警告横幅功能，默认开启\n2. 横幅支持拖拽持久化位置，多语言适配\n3. 实现横幅防篡改保护，移除后自动替换为警告页\n4. 更新文档与测试用例覆盖新功能\n\n* refactor(dev-bridge): 新增双重开关机制并完善防篡改逻辑\n\n1. 为dev-bridge注入逻辑新增宿主总开关DEV_BRIDGE_ENABLED\n2. 大幅优化横幅防篡改可见性判断，覆盖更多隐藏手段\n3. 更新文档与测试用例，补充未开启开关的反向测试\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update browser-tests.yml\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlEHDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4ukQAFh58KpOdtkq15JrPrxgEfBL\nGE10CJAEI9DT+KNmywhqavCBJ2dRvK6q72UfDy/5Erkc2PdrX0Wl1d3o9gt0gA54\nHqOlvW8hWfNXBQzBvZb3ZdiAntmYdbgPcrgLG5DvJrTD6cKqvN6/+QkumkdyWfi+\nQxAfMguBQ6f8Ofptt7isfDCb3AFEgotOHEStW3INY91jiz+GZDDcxBn/y6LYYAMs\nNU1esfrJUH37VkjLlYgJtkwo6IRiYeh8IaxjvTQnALk6RdNCbpHbkrp3LGHGh4I0\nX2x7hHYTtoxGkdPOFDQWGGD+QueR7ZiJLyG+EggJZB+fA1LjY1Eih5AbKy0JwFtE\ncFnCKUyy7LB+NoIOwB8A0zZzR82yGbYpzQOgpjj2UcKw0sZS8o/f8vmamm6Zur0R\nzPYtCxhlRyO9Zwf3qoy11aY4sbugkamUkGX9IYxoz9UwqEdEXRcqhdRXiD0oLGVq\nQYvumVPmXMiWmsQb3Ir3idrrRPbY9Yjdzin5S8CeR4ceIc45CMg9wraszgx+LL4J\nySuiAinLZpJ9gMayzwp5UbFjmQMvI2xtHVP+P+poZ3uQX6voU5GPN324gjNQETen\ndlXEJ7o3GYZStdG+03VtPAK56m7cB6v97cSU4QUuOjZqqy7S18r9rfSzyDHOkuXr\nvLDn+mDFaCYTNvfwZ+wR\n=pmKj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:44:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/ceb9e2e7ad8debba50852601ecc69638c1cd08b4","node_id":"C_kwDOPqdGa9oAKGNlYjllMmU3YWQ4ZGViYmE1MDg1MjYwMWVjYzY5NjM4YzFjZDA4YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/8258f10a398fc4d791f6fe9560efd50367a3ae5f","sha":"8258f10a398fc4d791f6fe9560efd50367a3ae5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/8258f10a398fc4d791f6fe9560efd50367a3ae5f"}],"sha":"ceb9e2e7ad8debba50852601ecc69638c1cd08b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/ceb9e2e7ad8debba50852601ecc69638c1cd08b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/8258f10a398fc4d791f6fe9560efd50367a3ae5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T18:54:24Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T18:54:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: crypto-e2ee import path in LocalUser (#67)\n\n* fix: crypto-e2ee import path in LocalUser\n\nUpdate nos/user/user.js to import ../crypto/crypto-e2ee.js instead of ../../crypto/crypto-e2ee.js. This corrects the relative module path used when calling tryDecryptBinary in LocalUser, preventing module resolution/runtime import failures during binary decryption.\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix(cred): 修复cred协议仅走服务器中转的逻辑与文档\n\n1.  在RemoteUser中添加RTC路径cred消息的告警，避免无处理的异常消息\n2.  重构cred请求发送逻辑，强制使用server.sendToUser而非remoteUser.send，确保cred消息始终经服务器中转\n3.  补充cred协议的诊断日志系统，便于CI环境排查问题\n4.  更新CONTEXT.md文档，说明cred协议必须走服务器中转的原因\n5.  优化findSessionId的错误信息，携带更多调试细节\n6.  完善请求失败时的错误信息，附带协议层诊断日志\n\n* build file\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f394a0a02df7173549adbda47f29637791c1443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/3f394a0a02df7173549adbda47f29637791c1443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/8258f10a398fc4d791f6fe9560efd50367a3ae5f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f394a0a02df7173549adbda47f29637791c1443\nparent 9e36e5e8df1e2b83f007927e7e97f821a6b2a81b\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1788029664 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788029664 +0800\n\nfix: crypto-e2ee import path in LocalUser (#67)\n\n* fix: crypto-e2ee import path in LocalUser\n\nUpdate nos/user/user.js to import ../crypto/crypto-e2ee.js instead of ../../crypto/crypto-e2ee.js. This corrects the relative module path used when calling tryDecryptBinary in LocalUser, preventing module resolution/runtime import failures during binary decryption.\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix(cred): 修复cred协议仅走服务器中转的逻辑与文档\n\n1.  在RemoteUser中添加RTC路径cred消息的告警，避免无处理的异常消息\n2.  重构cred请求发送逻辑，强制使用server.sendToUser而非remoteUser.send，确保cred消息始终经服务器中转\n3.  补充cred协议的诊断日志系统，便于CI环境排查问题\n4.  更新CONTEXT.md文档，说明cred协议必须走服务器中转的原因\n5.  优化findSessionId的错误信息，携带更多调试细节\n6.  完善请求失败时的错误信息，附带协议层诊断日志\n\n* build file\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkyrgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2dgQAAdJkKJQ933xsPjkkGOZoJ4S\nVQOzgwxfHhuvRLchmvlcNMl0CL0jGEHs2e3Dl9MabBi8DAfVmYD1vJVb2cHxeDIf\nlz42eOLMCAkcZK22snE6yFd8LlL1rB7z3z0GeWY7OHyLG7ODGOkwUTJ0/qBzdcSl\nj8Uok0JE8+A64WXRaCX7lojYy7YbL1ZBTqMQLoqA/VCHY0atPN/NtVDGtcFUmYkQ\n48mlAdIx87JB+Pt3kQHIcsFUfleKUpCwT9oYNmdtxwCg3MFrxT+qNM33DGIb3wBD\nzEHa2jw1euZyKa9UaEieoiUTBBUQblGhKGtyngyKsfv0cR+MJbEY+uTR/3f+yTp8\npAxto9yCRRr1YMn5sphbDAoTOyA/x6VjbpO9RFYVMqvGKxO8XLzx16P/IFBNpY0M\nycdFGJYTspUzSc/w1WYmXNreZ1zBCKKAKK6WhE4pxZOzTvVkO/e6jBUpBqLzm4i5\nWQHi8sWHHy4bIQKZJW7bA1TDMbnSr5mHr1cuLX7vSreq6itf+juXng6P4Zo7pZ9u\n+7QNMGY6r8/e22VZhLlUf9w3pZESI5o+6oJJO/R3mrWtIsHHqJUtLt77pLpjIBxH\nq1Mee6IpMHCRpkagJ1/Kjowem8gio1InM+P4YF147sIuMEoY4it+IggvcKgtSP4w\nfrPFGFZq0NGX8qJuZsFK\n=TfkY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T18:54:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi