6)\n\n* feat: Use pull-by-key for credentials\n\n* fix(credential): 修复本地用户profile读取逻辑\n\n调整CredentialManager的getCred方法，将本地用户自己的profile数据从certs store读取改为从data store的getInfo()获取，并更新文档说明该规则\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bf3ec500dd57385b0afda6fd302c531bf416396","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/1bf3ec500dd57385b0afda6fd302c531bf416396"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/9e36e5e8df1e2b83f007927e7e97f821a6b2a81b","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bf3ec500dd57385b0afda6fd302c531bf416396\nparent f8af37be677fd39dc38d9fea065ec52140a2f87f\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787668283 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787668283 +0800\n\nfeat: Use pull-by-key for credentials (#66)\n\n* feat: Use pull-by-key for credentials\n\n* fix(credential): 修复本地用户profile读取逻辑\n\n调整CredentialManager的getCred方法，将本地用户自己的profile数据从certs store读取改为从data store的getInfo()获取，并更新文档说明该规则\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjac7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6UAQABEAJWQbYbA9J4EvdJmJlQtH\nyZ+mEVtgoHcpoQL+s9mb7MhBJ8a2qvF/WEJm5xUPnnKuJBnRvDyVmY1/80pOaVJf\nmaP4OxRxgh6I/dkTV0155hKk/aBbi97FJB8WGB0MB64B0a38e5gvQt2kltiLS/FJ\nlFg2mxkb/Cl8i151sCoOti82GztH/KZomEozXtRg04wbdeEeiY8rx9YMR6xKoBlX\nLIDKAoPcnrejmFGao9UjJuBTra8d0KAXSw1CJGe9SbL3OXJyExT5EyvbyEuMm9g1\nr1poaatQYcgxmz/pu0ocCZ6YSHssDD3JxxGv3K+HiyTYLazuS5IHUxL0pdiltb2p\n7t4UAUpIZ/Sp56UuEgQPysJCsNTAtqGXjUn8wYbu00IIaAEwy2LPb4iZtQmHTvI6\ne/RQjXa2cqcg5abBC7hq71GjnQ5bOTPqeXwpFi+01Z+cH32zat4s060KglE1DIcD\nFTR8434w3encHUp1Py2xWYZ4UIXcOWyBzARGozzb7+1SPIopoKUujwHk/ikZupYA\nX5zc/PusXdeCPv9uHbpTzGXQAGwu8/zdm4E/bWy/s/2w2MdrSFnrZMsNlpUb50my\nbt6WpCafxArpP9BoLqysQaPaCMi5eHyDRbQ6cF+xrqS3pGqa8mtggX+BBRAhsY7M\nkc5IpGKIaH8D0YmPCbWn\n=DjMr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T14:31:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/9e36e5e8df1e2b83f007927e7e97f821a6b2a81b","node_id":"C_kwDOPqdGa9oAKDllMzZlNWU4ZGYxZTJiODNmMDA3OTI3ZTdlOTdmODIxYTZiMmE4MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/f8af37be677fd39dc38d9fea065ec52140a2f87f","sha":"f8af37be677fd39dc38d9fea065ec52140a2f87f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/f8af37be677fd39dc38d9fea065ec52140a2f87f"}],"sha":"9e36e5e8df1e2b83f007927e7e97f821a6b2a81b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/9e36e5e8df1e2b83f007927e7e97f821a6b2a81b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/f8af37be677fd39dc38d9fea065ec52140a2f87f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T16:47:12Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T16:47:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Enhance locale-text guidelines and clarify getLocaleText usage (#65)\n\n* Add strict format guidelines for locale-text\n\nAdd explicit documentation that locale-text entries must follow a fixed HTML/JS format so the nos-tool/locale-text-tool can reliably scan and generate locale-text.json. Documents include examples and rules: HTML entries must be wrapped in <locale-text> with lang attributes per element; JS must use getLocaleText({cn, en}) with {key} placeholders and vars (no template interpolation). Clarifies that nonconforming strings won''t be collected. Updated files: .agents/skills/noneos-core-docs/references/locale-text.md, CONTEXT.md, nos/locale-text/README.md.\n\n* Clarify getLocaleText usage wording\n\nReplace ambiguous “JS 中” wording with “脚本中” and clarify that getLocaleText should be called from either inline <script> or standalone .js/.mjs files. Reiterate that dynamic text must be passed as a language object to getLocaleText and that dynamic values use {key} placeholders + vars (do not use template-string interpolation). Files updated: .agents/skills/noneos-core-docs/references/locale-text.md, CONTEXT.md, nos/locale-text/README.md.\n\n* docs(locale-text): update docs and add html inline script extraction support\n\n补充了文档中关于HTML文件提取范围的说明，新增对内联script以及template内嵌脚本中getLocaleText调用的提取逻辑\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7987b9b10257a975d20447ab9f0f62595ef46497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/7987b9b10257a975d20447ab9f0f62595ef46497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/f8af37be677fd39dc38d9fea065ec52140a2f87f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7987b9b10257a975d20447ab9f0f62595ef46497\nparent 81713cc9e5a52b1e918f08d7ee9568330f38cf5d\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787590032 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787590032 +0800\n\nfix: Enhance locale-text guidelines and clarify getLocaleText usage (#65)\n\n* Add strict format guidelines for locale-text\n\nAdd explicit documentation that locale-text entries must follow a fixed HTML/JS format so the nos-tool/locale-text-tool can reliably scan and generate locale-text.json. Documents include examples and rules: HTML entries must be wrapped in <locale-text> with lang attributes per element; JS must use getLocaleText({cn, en}) with {key} placeholders and vars (no template interpolation). Clarifies that nonconforming strings won''t be collected. Updated files: .agents/skills/noneos-core-docs/references/locale-text.md, CONTEXT.md, nos/locale-text/README.md.\n\n* Clarify getLocaleText usage wording\n\nReplace ambiguous “JS 中” wording with “脚本中” and clarify that getLocaleText should be called from either inline <script> or standalone .js/.mjs files. Reiterate that dynamic text must be passed as a language object to getLocaleText and that dynamic values use {key} placeholders + vars (do not use template-string interpolation). Files updated: .agents/skills/noneos-core-docs/references/locale-text.md, CONTEXT.md, nos/locale-text/README.md.\n\n* docs(locale-text): update docs and add html inline script extraction support\n\n补充了文档中关于HTML文件提取范围的说明，新增对内联script以及template内嵌脚本中getLocaleText调用的提取逻辑\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjHWQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgdUQAEnFXr2hCqI4FlI2IxxlpzS2\namsdLSVWv53xfDotXEOIfVFe7UCjhnOW2U0s/tzYTizGWtLb/PcvehphOyvRvu5a\ncjLRY6HP0tudjXthiwQ0KLR4cUKU0+e05muEKsF6KUupGyYT8LFJQPfqZtM35bvt\nTYE91YDhdeu7krdxhKi0NoWuiyTXs0e8xmdwG4CEyogO5c/E1uTEWewVug4sC5m6\nLlzZC/c3z7nhOrdf8dVWxJGWVUVBYYWPmXNKB7DCwdl/njK27w6TbjiLCr0DL3za\n9QamtwYUBgSGjEQoEJ2ghNRRqfcW2KlwainWFbs0JpaDW6L/YIHyOJn1puscdnU6\nOy3jxe/mSkDwpXHbsJEgFJgrRlGGhxkdUvBPN8eePuE0T3HLQN86hT886l+x/AQr\nXArPbQPb+aaRTuwo50kYSGpZjt2b9o1aC38rCDi42Jcly+1y2+T0Zm47ZYTcnKuc\nI6CyR0T8ILSFrTiaFBa2We1ULl0B9yZFT6eUYV1OwKmiLYqTlB4F8l5yc/HipAJl\nnR07mZuHydn1ceV2NkTPSEqdeYNmnpZ1uCyyh6lxA3YDEu4EwfHuGDoO35SMplUq\nS+P/5t89hXystQy9Ry1WkwWW7+Eii1CG/bPArnzeZ6QtX+IUoMoQvBv7aEkfz90J\nVhGFSaSbNHMXYGtL5FW2\n=8xPV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-24T16:47:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c