name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Unify credentials (#64)\n\n* feat: Unify credentials and rename server to handshake\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix(user/db): 修复证书分页游标索引键范围和跨键过滤问题\n\n1. 修正IDB索引分页的游标范围，使用only(indexKey)锁定索引键集\n2. 增加同索引键内主键过滤逻辑，跳过游标起始前的重复键记录\n3. 补充分页测试用例，验证分页不混入其他角色的干扰数据\n4. 更新文档说明IDB索引游标的range限制和分页实现细节\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec8b4e93ed737835fab090a5d3dd058451178815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/ec8b4e93ed737835fab090a5d3dd058451178815"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/81713cc9e5a52b1e918f08d7ee9568330f38cf5d","verification":{"payload":"tree ec8b4e93ed737835fab090a5d3dd058451178815\nparent 3cba72b5dcb984e1b005f999c226e28a5b0cda41\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787583876 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787583876 +0800\n\nfeat: Unify credentials (#64)\n\n* feat: Unify credentials and rename server to handshake\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix(user/db): 修复证书分页游标索引键范围和跨键过滤问题\n\n1. 修正IDB索引分页的游标范围，使用only(indexKey)锁定索引键集\n2. 增加同索引键内主键过滤逻辑，跳过游标起始前的重复键记录\n3. 补充分页测试用例，验证分页不混入其他角色的干扰数据\n4. 更新文档说明IDB索引游标的range限制和分页实现细节\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjF2ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWMkQABe0RZ9hKIyO3MCnVLRGU+4c\n9YaJ1BvNzYMNHzUNVY5R/BZt01KrWh7mOxVuUe0ek4MOhX36FfT6NMeCmutfklRO\nstzh4bnX5YkGEzgpId1nsPyMNR1ECEpY0/twnoZ8nvOTY4cqCcDFmvXzcBOq+1yW\ncwHWfFPu46vgMf+nZ6j2NQOZNP/bCA8pzHOMsjLhdx1ECNnNlKiY8R9AKfmOsyTy\nbG8poV/2+r2N3kLQ79MGJ1W1sRzmzB2BE414KGo5nDYi5RFmeKL7SKEjDdySYtuN\nAix4eVYzNXUtU7+VskY9MGKcNWndiO02c/l3mcCCt/uXWhnOLrWLBPfeHjoOrlcN\n5ZL4VNTlebY3StdFmo/LmE9NjCVouLIQsX4SOTrKW70D+6W8JZ7zU5WIkSI+f1Gu\nPVFMHv7ky6JlCBmH6b14yJEG0qEmeQmR5ZxBzZpawr0C7zJLaOGqiBjlVU59RYw2\nSIZs1cZBI22l/9xKdDxq1PODeA69ddPWBJnBnlfZMt74qpMRwZE6ETKi1ak6URpH\ntWm+F+z0LF6POW5+S5Dwi15qeXfTgel3Dp4w4TSnvT0i1sYFZ7Wd