po}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/3cba72b5dcb984e1b005f999c226e28a5b0cda41","node_id":"C_kwDOPqdGa9oAKDNjYmE3MmI1ZGNiOTg0ZTFiMDA1Zjk5OWMyMjZlMjhhNWIwY2RhNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97","sha":"4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97"}],"sha":"3cba72b5dcb984e1b005f999c226e28a5b0cda41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/3cba72b5dcb984e1b005f999c226e28a5b0cda41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T18:07:42Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T18:07:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: Refactor UI to use senti-ui color system and update dependencies (#62)\n\n* refactor: 迁移至senti-ui颜色体系，移除旧palette和theme文件\n\n替换了多处旧的MD系统颜色变量，移除了本地的palette.css和theme.css，通过CDN引入senti-ui启动脚本以统一颜色系统\n\n* chore: 更新所有 senti-ui 依赖版本到 latest\n\n本次提交将项目内所有引用的 senti-ui 包从固定的 1.0.6 版本切换到 latest 版本，\n同时重构了文件管理器页面的UI结构，使用官方组件库重构列表展示和交互逻辑，优化了样式细节与用户体验。\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* feat(user-name): add auto retry for username loading, track error info\n\n- 新增名片加载失败自动重试机制，最多重试3次且间隔递增\n- 增加userId变更时自动作废旧重试轮次的逻辑\n- 新增lastLoadError用于记录失败步骤与原始错误信息\n- 补充测试前等待服务器连接完成的逻辑，完善测试诊断信息\n\n* fix(user-name): 完善加载错误记录与调试信息\n\n1. 新增lastLoadErrors数组存储所有加载错误历史\n2. 优化测试用例中的等待逻辑，同时等待双方连接完成\n3. 新增default用户连接状态与目标用户在线状态的调试信息\n\n* chore: release version 4.4.3\n\n* Update user-name.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab6471e45342e90f78441102e8d328fdc41e2430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/ab6471e45342e90f78441102e8d328fdc41e2430"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97","verification":{"payload":"tree ab6471e45342e90f78441102e8d328fdc41e2430\nparent 2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787422062 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787422062 +0800\n\nrefactor: Refactor UI to use senti-ui color system and update dependencies (#62)\n\n* refactor: 迁移至senti-ui颜色体系，移除旧palette和theme文件\n\n替换了多处旧的MD系统颜色变量，移除了本地的palette.css和theme.css，通过CDN引入senti-ui启动脚本以统一颜色系统\n\n* chore: 更新所有 senti-ui 依赖版本到 latest\n\n本次提交将项目内所有引用的 senti-ui 包从固定的 1.0.6 版本切换到 latest 版本，\n同时重构了文件管理器页面的UI结构，使用官方组件库重构列表展示和交互逻辑，优化了样式细节与用户体验。\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* feat(user-name): add auto retry for username loading, track error info\n\n- 新增名片加载失败自动重试机制，最多重试3次且间隔递增\n- 增加userId变更时自动作废旧重试轮次的逻辑\n- 新增lastLoadError用于记录失败步骤与原始错误信息\n- 补充测试前等待服务器连接完成的逻辑，完善测试诊断信息\n\n* fix(user-name): 完善加载错误记录与调试信息\n\n1. 新增lastLoadErrors数组存储所有加载错误历史\n2. 优化测试用例中的等待逻辑，同时等待双方连接完成\n3. 新增default用户连接状态与目标用户在线状态的调试信息\n\n* chore: release version 4.4.3\n\n* Update user-name.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqieVuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkzYQADzFAZyDmJEEvIaYNfsLVHqq\nMVK8iVtwHuPpJkuCdH//ycC3JVcTsvKVX/JlyxI9VZoWqfiyHd26AQ9lo1ROLJTO\nZWNgsW9u21puoWDzzegsF0OpcY9X2nmOTMxdsUpMZD7PxOv2RhqrcqlhOCa2riMk\n0gLHDpR1UaWiuLcHYh8TJFeTyoj/R85Sm9V/KdYmUPSUnf/UjFmm75quTjcK8BgZ\nZLn/E1VKvoccxnx8UgtGSo7fj+2Xea41FVTjkzeXXJZXmJsrXGfyb9HdCJyIz7EJ\nwxBY/a3yDHKAyRDnwNlS0IdeTz/CMGIeeCc7YiAhdF2h4Q8MkCZ+hOgyWuSb3G/z\nBiOMMxdvLX0sC3hKJCZLpqTMCJ7dYqxyFMpYL0UNVIaNm3LEb2Q8rPY0PCtNgD4K\nvnS/YDXCVfpiKTfsE/ZIJQzH7IqBG/iR2C/kNly0Jqtq3ZF4sLpReNCMnX0qLt9j\nUJ/jtjVedK/XBR3jDcmMIYJOrYJEHvRqMRrJln11nnANkqUP/fq7Kce5QbfBThNu\nONe13cxyxNckF9kacPV8+KAMj4ePhL0nFh7Y+rmzIhb0+14sU1cSx84QFdytaynu\nwTEOyixeJHZJr+r0cGkNq8KefdtnNdKvPAX25sv/tpi14hM8taBA83LxmWwJR/CR\nfk0oEspnFqQ3us/RnqqA\n=FYDu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-22T18:07:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97","node_id":"C_kwDOPqdGa9oAKDRiYWRmZDE2OWQ3ZmZhNzJiNGU2NzkyNGI0ZDJmYWE2MmYzN2VlOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f","sha":"2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f"}],"sha":"4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/4badfd169d7ffa72b4e67924b4d2faa62f37ee97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T12:06:35Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T12:06:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Migrate UI components from punch-ui to senti-ui and update styles (#61)\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* chore(locale-text-tool): 替换punch-ui为senti-ui资源源\n\n将项目内的punch-ui CDN资源替换为jsDelivr托管的senti-ui，移除了冗余的全局样式引入\n\n* chore(rtc-tool): 替换UI组件源到jsdelivr CDN并移除旧样式\n\n将原本从punch-ui-v2加载的组件替换为senti-ui的jsdelivr源，移除了全局样式引入，统一更新组件标签与样式配置\n\n* refactor: 移除旧的mcu-ts颜色工具并升级UI库\n\n1.  删除了nos-tool/studio/util/mcu-ts目录下的所有颜色工具代码\n2.  移除了index.html中引入的旧punch-ui样式和colors.css\n3.  将UI组件库从punch-ui替换为senti-ui\n4.  批量替换项目内的Material3颜色变量为官方系统色值\n5.  优化了多处UI组件的样式和交互逻辑\n\n* chore: 统一替换senti-ui依赖版本为固定提交哈希\n\n1.  将所有senti-ui的CDN引用从@main替换为固定commit d680267\n2.  为三个工具页面添加根主题样式适配明暗模式\n3.  为studio页面的竖屏切换按钮添加标题提示\n4.  删除无用的playwright快照文件\n\n* chore: 更新所有 senti-ui 依赖到正式版 1.0.4\n\n将项目中所有引用的 senti-ui 从旧的提交版本 d680267b51da8667cce2aca97eec2118c76ec3c0 切换到正式发布的 1.0.4 版本，统一依赖版本来源\n\n* refactor(system-info): 替换UI库并更新Material主题变量\n\n替换原有Punch UI为Senti UI，将硬编码样式替换为Material Design系统颜色变量，统一组件样式风格\n\n* chore: 更新所有 senti-ui 依赖到 1.0.6 版本并替换旧组件命名\n\n统一将项目内的 punch-ui 依赖替换为 cdn 上的 senti-ui 1.0.6 版本，同时将所有旧的 p- 前缀组件替换为新的 st- 前缀组件，调整部分样式和弹窗插槽命名以适配新组件库。\n\n* docs: 完成UI组件库从punch-ui到senti-ui的迁移更新\n\n更新了文档中的视觉规范说明，替换了所有punch-ui相关的组件库引用，修正了颜色依赖的说明，并更新了senti-ui的文档下载地址\n\n* refactor: 统一更新所有文件中的仓库源地址\n\n将所有引用的kirakiray/ofa.js和外部CDN的senti-ui资源，替换为统一的gh/ofajs组织源和本地路径，确保资源引用一致性\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update user-shared-storage.sb.html\n\n* fix: some case\n\n* fix case\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c5200c42c386c9a6df931622b733a797e34c538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/3c5200c42c386c9a6df931622b733a797e34c538"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c5200c42c386c9a6df931622b733a797e34c538\nparent 7181d8f53612b1009c52fe5a2aba7cf9b5a69aec\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787400395 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787400395 +0800\n\nfeat: Migrate UI components from punch-ui to senti-ui and update styles (#61)\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* chore(locale-text-tool): 替换punch-ui为senti-ui资源源\n\n将项目内的punch-ui CDN资源替换为jsDelivr托管的senti-ui，移除了冗余的全局样式引入\n\n* chore(rtc-tool): 替换UI组件源到jsdelivr CDN并移除旧样式\n\n将原本从punch-ui-v2加载的组件替换为senti-ui的jsdelivr源，移除了全局样式引入，统一更新组件标签与样式配置\n\n* refactor: 移除旧的mcu-ts颜色工具并升级UI库\n\n1.  删除了nos-tool/studio/util/mcu-ts目录下的所有颜色工具代码\n2.  移除了index.html中引入的旧punch-ui样式和colors.css\n3.  将UI组件库从punch-ui替换为senti-ui\n4.  批量替换项目内的Material3颜色变量为官方系统色值\n5.  优化了多处UI组件的样式和交互逻辑\n\n* chore: 统一替换senti-ui依赖版本为固定提交哈希\n\n1.  将所有senti-ui的CDN引用从@main替换为固定commit d680267\n2.  为三个工具页面添加根主题样式适配明暗模式\n3.  为studio页面的竖屏切换按钮添加标题提示\n4.  删除无用的playwright快照文件\n\n* chore: 更新所有 senti-ui 依赖到正式版 1.0.4\n\n将项目中所有引用的 senti-ui 从旧的提交版本 d680267b51da8667cce2aca97eec2118c76ec3c0 切换到正式发布的 1.0.4 版本，统一依赖版本来源\n\n* refactor(system-info): 替换UI库并更新Material主题变量\n\n替换原有Punch UI为Senti UI，将硬编码样式替换为Material Design系统颜色变量，统一组件样式风格\n\n* chore: 更新所有 senti-ui 依赖到 1.0.6 版本并替换旧组件命名\n\n统一将项目内的 punch-ui 依赖替换为 cdn 上的 senti-ui 1.0.6 版本，同时将所有旧的 p- 前缀组件替换为新的 st- 前缀组件，调整部分样式和弹窗插槽命名以适配新组件库。\n\n* docs: 完成UI组件库从punch-ui到senti-ui的迁移更新\n\n更新了文档中的视觉规范说明，替换了所有punch-ui相关的组件库引用，修正了颜色依赖的说明，并更新了senti-ui的文档下载地址\n\n* refactor: 统一更新所有文件中的仓库源地址\n\n将所有引用的kirakiray/ofa.js和外部CDN的senti-ui资源，替换为统一的gh/ofajs组织源和本地路径，确保资源引用一致性\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update user-shared-storage.sb.html\n\n* fix: some case\n\n* fix case\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiZDLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzpgQAKGEBufBBB3Ly78VkIJ/u8aP\n7ZJI7qBwPvp8Y+NohVtNn/DDb1EA+6EOnDh6Yj1hmSOfiCVA1tVo10hvyPYBmdy1\nS4o9n/8Yb5WB8vvtjd0eDauD4n8mDGFZ8WJWnU9yCOAeu8S/LE7pNR56IqWU/wUK\ncXxG3AImemaW3l5AaYrXR9mUp4G7fTD061P1pctSY3imuHSPOFAttgRJj+mTHqCF\nGKh4fXiEE6KZQgeKEASXsm1iUpiLs9MSSS3sHIJvQ35u0+XwQQBuFVt3W28/FuB2\nY59lI+A6DqjWDk6tzzAtzD8