mmits/2b9c0b419c90abb2ffa5b6d0c5971a714ccb299f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/7181d8f53612b1009c52fe5a2aba7cf9b5a69aec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T14:31:22Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T14:31:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add User storage (#60)\n\n* feat(user): add user-specific storage feature\n\n实现用户专属存储功能，基于nos/storage封装，为每个LocalUser提供隔离的IndexedDB存储空间。新增getStorage方法支持自定义子空间，deleteUser会联动清理该用户创建的全部存储，同时补充文档与测试用例。\n\n* docs(skills): add user-specific storage documentation\n\nadd user-isolated storage usage guide and related docs for LocalUser\n\n* docs: 移除远端文件系统相关的冗余文档和代码\n\n移除了远端用户目录路径的文档说明、相关注释代码，以及不再需要的远端FS模块导入逻辑，清理了过时的远端文件系统相关配置说明\n\n* feat(user,docs): add shared storage support and related docs\n\n1. 新增 shareStorage API 实现，支持显式开启/关闭只读存储共享\n2. 新增共享存储相关文档说明与使用示例\n3. 完善用户数据库的共享存储登记逻辑\n4. 修复 deleteUser 的 indexedDB 删除重试逻辑\n5. 添加共享存储功能测试用例\n\n* backup\n\n* refactor(user,db): remove debug logs and optimize db connection & server connect\n\n1. remove all nos-debug console logs across codebase\n2. rewrite indexedDB cache logic to fix connection leak and blocking issues\n3. add auto-close timer for idle db connections\n4. optimize server auto-connect logic to avoid blocking user deletion\n5. add abort checks for connection attempts during user deletion\n\n* feat(user,docs): implement and document remote shared storage read protocol\n\n实现远端只读共享存储的入站协议处理，新增三道安全校验防线，补充全量文档与测试用例：\n1. 定义SHARED_STORAGE_READ_OPS白名单限制仅允许getItem/has/key/length/keys/entries操作\n2. 新增#handleStorageRequest方法处理__storage_req消息，完成前缀/已共享/只读校验\n3. 补全各文档中的协议细节与使用说明\n4. 新增4组测试用例覆盖协议全流程与异常场景\n\n* feat: 实现远端用户共享存储只读访问能力\n\n1.  新增RemoteUser类的getStorage方法，支持获取远端用户共享的只读存储代理\n2.  实现共享存储请求超时、离线、权限错误处理，错误携带code标识\n3.  新增代理缓存机制，同一(userId, name)复用代理实例\n4.  补充完整文档与测试用例，覆盖读写拦截、错误场景、数据隔离等情况\n\n* Update all.html\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* feat(user, docs): add requestCard api and improve storage reliability\n\n1. 实现user.card.requestCard方法，支持自动重试的网络名片刷新\n2. 新增共享存储超时/发送失败自动重发机制，添加too_large错误处理\n3. 补充相关文档与测试用例，完善可靠性说明\n\n* Update connect-user.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"82aa7a89fdccc1f3cd3a4fb1729da8ad5b92b805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/82aa7a89fdccc1f3cd3a4fb1729da8ad5b92b805"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/7181d8f53612b1009c52fe5a2aba7cf9b5a69aec","verification":{"payload":"tree 82aa7a89fdccc1f3cd3a4fb1729da8ad5b92b805\nparent 3c2cd0abe57e3226fefb2b9bd2de9f64f71b9b1c\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1786890682 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786890682 +0800\n\nfeat: add User storage (#60)\n\n* feat(user): add user-specific storage feature\n\n实现用户专属存储功能，基于nos/storage封装，为每个LocalUser提供隔离的IndexedDB存储空间。新增getStorage方法支持自定义子空间，deleteUser会联动清理该用户创建的全部存储，同时补充文档与测试用例。\n\n* docs(skills): add user-specific storage documentation\n\nadd user-isolated storage usage guide and related docs for LocalUser\n\n* docs: 移除远端文件系统相关的冗余文档和代码\n\n移除了远端用户目录路径的文档说明、相关注释代码，以及不再需要的远端FS模块导入逻辑，清理了过时的远端文件系统相关配置说明\n\n* feat(user,docs): add shared storage support and related docs\n\n1. 新增 shareStorage API 实现，支持显式开启/关闭只读存储共享\n2. 新增共享存储相关文档说明与使用示例\n3. 完善用户数据库的共享存储登记逻辑\n4. 修复 deleteUser 的 indexedDB 删除重试逻辑\n5. 添加共享存储功能测试用例\n\n* backup\n\n* refactor(user,db): remove debug logs and optimize db connection & server connect\n\n1. remove all nos-debug console logs across codebase\n2. rewrite indexedDB cache logic to fix connection leak and blocking issues\n3. add auto-close timer for idle db connections\n4. optimize server auto-connect logic to avoid blocking user deletion\n5. add abort checks for connection attempts during user deletion\n\n* feat(user,docs): implement and document remote shared storage read protocol\n\n实现远端只读共享存储的入站协议处理，新增三道安全校验防线，补充全量文档与测试用例：\n1. 定义SHARED_STORAGE_READ_OPS白名单限制仅允许getItem/has/key/length/keys/entries操作\n2. 新增#handleStorageRequest方法处理__storage_req消息，完成前缀/已共享/只读校验\n3. 补全各文档中的协议细节与使用说明\n4. 新增4组测试用例覆盖协议全流程与异常场景\n\n* feat: 实现远端用户共享存储只读访问能力\n\n1.  新增RemoteUser类的getStorage方法，支持获取远端用户共享的只读存储代理\n2.  实现共享存储请求超时、离线、权限错误处理，错误携带code标识\n3.  新增代理缓存机制，同一(userId, name)复用代理实例\n4.  补充完整文档与测试用例，覆盖读写拦截、错误场景、数据隔离等情况\n\n* Update all.html\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* feat(user, docs): add requestCard api and improve storage reliability\n\n1. 实现user.card.requestCard方法，支持自动重试的网络名片刷新\n2. 新增共享存储超时/发送失败自动重发机制，添加too_large错误处理\n3. 补充相关文档与测试用例，完善可靠性说明\n\n* Update connect-user.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgcm6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9+IQAK5tnEiHKAtMNwoWCgubaBUN\nntn/MDIjgp5oteOUFEnW9NG1OYfuudDBhuxF9kaeTgRgzLmtceZtlYLL+5wO1S1L\nhZ9D4BHz8EFXahKYNzv3XjDWIigY6PhALpzU89KeHd7N5JIR32jKePIVJ9SBaqPE\neKnZtKNW3DGx2KrO62z8bxQPHUnLKMe+mQIUS7+kb21lo0NYRkUXK6TP2qt2wLWU\nLcXzg7EyymwZQ7dsMR503rw7