upport for docker build, update CONTEXT.md with acceleration usage guide\n\n* feat(storage): add unmounted fs handle check and related docs\n\nrefactor(fs/storage): 实现 PICKED 标记优化未挂载句柄校验\n\n1. 新增 PICKED 全局符号标记未挂载的 open() 句柄，子孙句柄通过 root 继承该标记\n2. 重构 storage 校验逻辑，使用标记同步拦截未挂载句柄，移除原有的异步路径校验\n3. 更新文档与测试用例，适配新的校验机制与标记逻辑\n4. 优化模块加载，避免为读取常量引入不必要的 fs 模块依赖\n\n* feat(storage): add unmounted fs handle check and related docs\n\nrefactor(fs/storage): 实现 PICKED 标记优化未挂载句柄校验\n\n1. 新增 PICKED 全局符号标记未挂载的 open() 句柄，子孙句柄通过 root 继承该标记\n2. 重构 storage 校验逻辑，使用标记同步拦截未挂载句柄，移除原有的异步路径校验\n3. 更新文档与测试用例，适配新的校验机制与标记逻辑\n4. 优化模块加载，避免为读取常量引入不必要的 fs 模块依赖\n\n* refactor(n-icon): 替换自定义IndexedDB缓存为统一nos/storage\n\n1. 移除原有的db.js自定义IndexedDB实现\n2. 使用项目内置的nos/storage作为图标持久化缓存\n3. 更新文档中关于缓存依赖的说明，删除ever-cache相关内容\n4. 为图标缓存使用独立的存储空间避免键名冲突\n\n* chore: 移除AI相关模块与文档，更新项目配置\n\n* docs: add reliable messaging spec and optimize chunk fetch concurrency\n\n1. 新增应用层可靠消息投递完整规范文档\n2. 为文件拉取功能添加并发上限控制（8并发）\n3. 更新相关文档说明并发限制的原因与配置\n4. 修复测试用例中service worker注册等待逻辑\n5. 删除旧的全量测试页面\n\n* release: bump version to 4.4.0\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3eb508d0086c8e1010c82dc3f9544c0167335ed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/3eb508d0086c8e1010c82dc3f9544c0167335ed1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/cb08244d2ccde5ea85bd02585f27a04ffc2a9f27","verification":{"payload":"tree 3eb508d0086c8e1010c82dc3f9544c0167335ed1\nparent 10b73994180ad75667192a889977ecb269cc0ff9\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1786452529 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786452529 +0800\n\nfeat: Unified nos/storage layer, Docker-ready Rust server, and AI module cleanup (#59)\n\n* build(server/rust): add docker build related files and docs\n\nadd .dockerignore, docker config, Dockerfile and update CONTEXT.md with docker deployment guide\n\n* Update Cargo.toml\n\n* docs(server/rust): update docker build docs and add build args