","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:17:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: Rebuild host cache (#56)\n\n* revert code\n\n* feat(sw): add host offline cache feature\n\n实现宿主项目离线缓存功能，支持通过manifest声明缓存文件列表，提供：\n1.  新增host-cache-handler.js实现完整缓存逻辑\n2.  新增文档说明host-cache使用方式\n3.  新增/__host-cache路由查询缓存状态\n4.  支持通过postMessage触发缓存更新\n5.  自动预缓存与增量更新机制\n\n* feat(host-cache): add /__update-host-cache route to trigger host cache update\n\n- 新增`/__update-host-cache`特殊路由，支持主动触发宿主离线缓存更新\n- 实现`triggerHostCacheUpdate`方法，自动拉取最新manifest并对比版本更新\n- 更新文档说明更新流程和使用方式\n- 重构原有的postMessage更新逻辑，统一版本检查逻辑\n\n* fix(host-cache): 修复版本对比逻辑，从OPFS读取持久化版本而非内存\n\n调整了host缓存更新的版本对比逻辑，不再使用内存中的hostManifest变量，而是从OPFS中读取持久化的manifest版本进行对比，确保手动删除OPFS缓存后也能正确触发重新拉取。\n\n* test(host-cache): 新增 host-cache 功能的完整测试套件\n\n新增了测试所需的测试文件、manifest配置、测试用Service Worker，以及完整的端到端测试页面，覆盖了缓存注册、文件访问、OPFS存储、版本更新和环境清理等测试场景\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"593d54a118a3ac0a791f75470957722a0762c2bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/593d54a118a3ac0a791f75470957722a0762c2bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/7335659b5f57061c0f497d509042693b4375e288","verification":{"payload":"tree 593d54a118a3ac0a791f75470957722a0762c2bf\nparent 6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1785593860 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785593860 +0800\n\nrefactor: Rebuild host cache (#56)\n\n* revert code\n\n* feat(sw): add host offline cache feature\n\n实现宿主项目离线缓存功能，支持通过manifest声明缓存文件列表，提供：\n1.  新增host-cache-handler.js实现完整缓存逻辑\n2.  新增文档说明host-cache使用方式\n3.  新增/__host-cache路由查询缓存状态\n4.  支持通过postMessage触发缓存更新\n5.  自动预缓存与增量更新机制\n\n* feat(host-cache): add /__update-host-cache route to trigger host cache update\n\n- 新增`/__update-host-cache`特殊路由，支持主动触发宿主离线缓存更新\n- 实现`triggerHostCacheUpdate`方法，自动拉取最新manifest并对比版本更新\n- 更新文档说明更新流程和使用方式\n- 重构原有的postMessage更新逻辑，统一版本检查逻辑\n\n* fix(host-cache): 修复版本对比逻辑，从OPFS读取持久化版本而非内存\n\n调整了host缓存更新的版本对比逻辑，不再使用内存中的hostManifest变量，而是从OPFS中读取持久化的manifest版本进行对比，确保手动删除OPFS缓存后也能正确触发重新拉取。\n\n* test(host-cache): 新增 host-cache 功能的完整测试套件\n\n新增了测试所需的测试文件、manifest配置、测试用Service Worker，以及完整的端到端测试页面，覆盖了缓存注册、文件访问、OPFS存储、版本更新和环境清理等测试场景\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbgAECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5tEQAEaH6bjNcQA3zF+K5TJPnhZt\n/izDFoXSYqCkqRLv2V+AiJcOK53L+ZmcdLrkyV3+sq3MXahfe96qJSQ6nsZpCytw\nXRYtOO3iyNrqsm136Ke7TR/VcP6lqvrpK+BjByLBzbY3M+khm5c2I1Sw0dyzrBTB\nJyG5tgTqOhiLy34X0dB44gtaFNwJ6VbmpzeP/QiTzTbYwPZhX+O4Q6R6d5BLBSDg\nSpzAK0GK1w6gPEwv81Uw1oOQsfCr79cAbCnpD3MeZN5hOw/1e9j/fxfBUHPr3dUV\n+KS7piJ85+olsXXvga7fjstNhPUU+RXzffLFqfozgFuCjM/cKiiLI4RA4PkOvT4Z\n4cmrd3Q0ZjW2kPJcYCKRDanRlbsoq2zip8b80oIgFnE6QTF+PDGODo2na/lCEgSZ\n/OUCAFFC4UlFxyp/6jmD15QJgJIwLQIQ18K+k6AGB0w8m1Fg0+4n0DvgpsxANchk\n2ngqHiOs111QzZuLgY5C8Rp13XZXazWv/boNf41+GvW697hd7M/H2Vig6GomA1Wt\n777Qjnbyhca0s9MdmwX6fSaEs8uKQCQz7e5GLYnubgBtyIhgePg0ALxQjRBmaBI6\n3B7lBdLaupbivjH1peX7eQQ3BobtGZmgOeAuWHlkRlECnmDghbzxNGwwWqqUu58D\nM/OHNAlkuxXunXR//iYz\n=xatU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T14:17:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/7335659b5f57061c0f497d509042693b4375e288","node_id":"C_kwDOPqdGa9oAKDczMzU2NTliNWY1NzA2MWMwZjQ5N2Q1MDkwNDI2OTNiNDM3NWUyODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/noneos-core/commit/6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf","sha":"6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf"}],"sha":"7335659b5f57061c0f497d509042693b4375e288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/7335659b5f57061c0f497d509042693b4375e288"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T09:54:28Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T09:54:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: support host-cache feature (#55)\n\n* Update rtc-glare.sb.html\n\n* feat: 新增宿主应用缓存支持，优化版本检测逻辑\n\n1. 新增app-cache-handle.js实现应用缓存文件的OPFS读取与拦截\n2. 扩展SW配置接口，返回appCacheConfig信息\n3. 优化nos-tool版本检测，支持仅应用缓存升级场景\n4. 新增应用缓存自动安装流程\n5. 补充相关文档说明\n\n* fix(sw): 优化应用缓存兜底逻辑，未命中时回退网络\n\n1. 给handleAppCacheRequest添加request参数\n2. 缓存未命中或出错时直接fetch请求源网络资源\n3. 更新了函数注释说明新增的回退网络逻辑\n\n* refactor: 重命名应用缓存为宿主缓存，统一命名规范\n\n本次重构将所有与\"应用缓存\"相关的命名替换为\"宿主缓存\"，包括：\n1. 变量、函数名与配置字段重命名\n2. 文档与注释内容更新\n3. 拆分原有app-cache-handle模块为host-cache-handle\n4. 同步更新nos-tool中的缓存安装逻辑\n\n* fix(nos-tool): add missing host cache upgrade params to upgradable event\n\n补充了升级事件中缺失的主机缓存相关参数，确保触发upgradable事件时传递完整的额外信息\n\n* feat: add host cache feature and related docs\n\n1. 修复install逻辑中appCacheUpgradeOnly拼写错误为hostCacheUpgradeOnly\n2. 新增宿主项目离线缓存完整文档体系\n3. 扩展nos-version组件以支持宿主缓存升级检测\n4. 添加host-cache.md详细文档说明配置、原理与使用\n\n* chore: 更新版本签名与添加安装日志\n\n1. 更新nos.json中的签名时间和签名值\n2. 为host缓存安装流程添加状态日志，包括跳过更新、安装进度和安装完成提示\n\n* test(host-cache): 新增 host-cache 功能的完整测试用例\n\n新增了测试所需的测试文件、两个版本的manifest配置，以及完整的installHostCache核心逻辑测试页面，覆盖了文件写入、manifest副本存储、系统配置记录、版本跳过安装、版本升级和进度回调等场景。\n\n* Update bump.js\n\n* chore: release version 4.3.0\n\nupdate version number across all files, including package.json, nos.json, built sw files and version constants, also update signTime and signature in nos.json\n\n* fix(sw): 优化localhost环境下请求失败的回退逻辑\n\n当localhost:3002服务未启动时，直接使用当前静态服务器的资源进行请求，替代原有的官方源回退逻辑\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a1678cb43b0abc8190dfbf26fd02795d25451d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/8a1678cb43b0abc8190dfbf26fd02795d25451d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 8a1678cb43b0abc8190dfbf26fd02795d25451d9\nparent f76ae0d8d9ace9aaa80847acec88ea2f45064a5f\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1785578068 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785578068 +0800\n\nfeat: support host-cache feature (#55)\n\n* Update rtc-glare.sb.html\n\n* feat: 新增宿主应用缓存支持，优化版本检测逻辑\n\n1. 新增app-cache-handle.js实现应用缓存文件的OPFS读取与拦截\n2. 扩展SW配置接口，返回appCacheConfig信息\n3. 优化nos-tool版本检测，支持仅应用缓存升级场景\n4. 新增应用缓存自动安装流程\n5. 补充相关文档说明\n\n* fix(sw): 优化应用缓存兜底逻辑，未命中时回退网络\n\n1. 给handleAppCacheRequest添加request参数\n2. 缓存未命中或出错时直接fetch请求源网络资源\n3. 更新了函数注释说明新增的回退网络逻辑\n\n* refactor: 重命名应用缓存为宿主缓存，统一命名规范\n\n本次重构将所有与\"应用缓存\"相关的命名替换为\"宿主缓存\"，包括：\n1. 变量、函数名与配置字段重命名\n2. 文档与注释内容更新\n3. 拆分原有app-cache-handle模块为host-cache-handle\n4. 同步更新nos-tool中的缓存安装逻辑\n\n* fix(nos-tool): add missing host cache upgrade params to upgradable event\n\n补充了升级事件中缺失的主机缓存相关参数，确保触发upgradable事件时传递完整的额外信息\n\n* feat: add host cache feature and related docs\n\n1. 修复install逻辑中appCacheUpgradeOnly拼写错误为hostCacheUpgradeOnly\n2. 新增宿主项目离线缓存完整文档体系\n3. 扩展nos-version组件以支持宿主缓存升级检测\n4. 添加host-cache.md详细文档说明配置、原理与使用\n\n* chore: 更新版本签名与添加安装日志\n\n1. 更新nos.json中的签名时间和签名值\n2. 为host缓存安装流程添加状态日志，包括跳过更新、安装进度和安装完成提示\n\n* test(host-cache): 新增 host-cache 功能的完整测试用例\n\n新增了测试所需的测试文件、两个版本的manifest配置，以及完整的installHostCache核心逻辑测试页面，覆盖了文件写入、manifest副本存储、系统配置记录、版本跳过安装、版本升级和进度回调等场景。\n\n* Update bump.js\n\n* chore: release version 4.3.0\n\nupdate version number across all files, including package.json, nos.json, built sw files and version constants, also update signTime and signature in nos.json\n\n* fix(sw): 优化localhost环境下请求失败的回退逻辑\n\n当localhost:3002服务未启动时，直接使用当前静态服务器的资源进行请求，替代原有的官方源回退逻辑\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbcJUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7nkQABCYAmcH75GHF0x+3r8wYsVA\nCHdJ9LODd8GMIbFB9kXMN2HgShFTOAdtQD29ZrOucWhrHJxMA3ph2VJufM3jV1UV\nNNcA5BnXG4NOhj