://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/f76ae0d8d9ace9aaa80847acec88ea2f45064a5f"}],"sha":"6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/6a04052b6cbc01c722b1a4f7136d1c837b49c2cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/f76ae0d8d9ace9aaa80847acec88ea2f45064a5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T04:46:08Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T04:46:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(rtc): enhance connection stability with cooldown, glare fix, and resource cleanup (#54)\n\n* feat(nos/rtc): add rtc connection stabilization and logging\n\n- add detailed debug logging for rtc signal/state changes\n- add rtc connection cooldown to prevent pc storm on network jitter\n- refactor rtc state handling with unified peer cleanup and serialized pc operations\n- fix rtc glare handling and duplicate connection issues\n\n* refactor(user, rtc): 完善用户断开连接时的资源清理逻辑\n\n1. 新增 RemoteUser.dispose 方法清理内部定时器与状态\n2. 调整 LocalUser.disconnectUser 清理顺序：先dispose再断RTC连接\n3. 新增 RTCManager.disconnectAllForUser 批量清理指定用户的所有RTC资源\n4. 新增工具方法#splitKey解析peer key获取用户与会话ID\n5. 新增2个测试用例验证PC资源清理与冷却期重连逻辑\n\n* style: 注释掉项目中所有的rtc相关调试日志\n\n移除了RemoteUser和RTCManager类内的全部console.log调试输出，减少运行时日志干扰，保留必要的warn级错误日志\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6a2abdaec280e50417df75510013ba786227dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/f6a2abdaec280e50417df75510013ba786227dbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/f76ae0d8d9ace9aaa80847acec88ea2f45064a5f","verification":{"payload":"tree f6a2abdaec280e50417df75510013ba786227dbe\nparent 7a84d7aa6def154dc0714be480c149685b277c05\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1785041168 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785041168 +0800\n\nfix(rtc): enhance connection stability with cooldown, glare fix, and resource cleanup (#54)\n\n* feat(nos/rtc): add rtc connection stabilization and logging\n\n- add detailed debug logging for rtc signal/state changes\n- add rtc connection cooldown to prevent pc storm on network jitter\n- refactor rtc state handling with unified peer cleanup and serialized pc operations\n- fix rtc glare handling and duplicate connection issues\n\n* refactor(user, rtc): 完善用户断开连接时的资源清理逻辑\n\n1. 新增 RemoteUser.dispose 方法清理内部定时器与状态\n2. 调整 LocalUser.disconnectUser 清理顺序：先dispose再断RTC连接\n3. 新增 RTCManager.disconnectAllForUser 批量清理指定用户的所有RTC资源\n4. 新增工具方法#splitKey解析peer key获取用户与会话ID\n5. 新增2个测试用例验证PC资源清理与冷却期重连逻辑\n\n* style: 注释掉项目中所有的rtc相关调试日志\n\n移除了RemoteUser和RTCManager类内的全部console.log调试输出，减少运行时日志干扰，保留必要的warn级错误日志\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZZEQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2hwQADxHvC2+m6evIHNz8sswZRPf\ndqjNq