are.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a2600a642f846988eff9fb3d31a501277800862","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/6a2600a642f846988eff9fb3d31a501277800862"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/7a84d7aa6def154dc0714be480c149685b277c05","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a2600a642f846988eff9fb3d31a501277800862\nparent 89a057e5b6451d102950d05161238bd3b8889027\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1785002540 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785002540 +0800\n\nfeat(rtc): implement Perfect Negotiation with ICE candidate buffering (#53)\n\n* feat(rtc): 完善WebRTC连接健壮性，新增glare处理与ICE缓冲\n\n1.  实现Perfect Negotiation解决glare冲突，根据userId字典序决定礼貌方\n2.  添加ICE候选缓冲机制，处理乱序到达的ICE信令\n3.  优化错误处理策略，仅在PC不可恢复时清理peer\n4.  更新文档并新增glare与ICE缓冲测试用例\n5.  支持默认STUN服务器与自定义ICE配置\n\n* Update connect-user-roundtrip.sb.html\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update rtc-glare.sb.html\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZPosCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEwUQABz1R22UXjVkZGi7qoDJTajP\neyCThm1HFUswXYWEg9lic8UhHm3sg0tyAq77VqUw4JXZdk7+xIZJ5pKY3ai5z3vp\nGkgCfjPz5lX7CtShDhq8gcb4BLoE6TQn5hQDq+Joqm5PlIXOHw6HpLSiVydz2ssc\nfD5AVP8FYTApA512zT6mz4mxaviSLS8DDEdawjCXTTuMw13xPtatYrNaF9EID4Sd\nyQixkl96ErsAOLqfPS4egm/qfBxVKU79fZ/39O/FKlkgMb5F2S42QYkHTRcdpKfW\n19CdPQzVNxeGIMfu3IA0F9UWq+ouWMzQazh5Lc6BVjsi8xj8TJRLFxbONkZ30tpr\nzIVCn160abeofebudEsqYR2Ch27YNRRragB9JMA+g32JTyeeX9hcu0aJW/TCe6wB\nMMw6RWoPNRPiMPVZYFRxAGxv+pmV8DgCuwr2nDVjOsY/mGPuZvoRHARlhWQnCP2U\nxp9sFrr82IrwRAB/ew5bQz2vKNWXSrVNMiIG0qRX690CtdZZ2z9x+nxPcCIhVxTO\nABKyvUb9eoV1K6i2QnVkhskN4TauNiICIrjGxT2bbb3n1Lh8TWWIx2vCX1m7jMgJ\nKuiBWBl6hvvBckJSuf5oHQRIwjAb0zy5eaz3dnB3ST66Lha2PyupPKwn/00LHwH1\nJ06k0/8PDSK9jiwNyBUe\n=wiVR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T18:02:21Z"}},"committer":{"avata