ynamic config support\n\n1. add rtc-tool web UI for managing STUN/TURN servers\n2. add runtime ICE config APIs to RTCManager\n3. add localStorage persistence for custom ICE server config\n4. update docs to reflect new dynamic ICE config capability\n\n* feat(system-info): add NoneOS system info tool page\n\nadd full set of system info page including version check, service worker management and system update functions\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"efb6f9c316fc0dc7815f31d578a2d66bf6da22a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/efb6f9c316fc0dc7815f31d578a2d66bf6da22a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/940a2f64beac267b3c2c0e8cf5cb509f77b131a3","verification":{"payload":"tree efb6f9c316fc0dc7815f31d578a2d66bf6da22a0\nparent c2f3736d267665d5a17ed45a2cd96feae8b82813\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1784721350 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784721350 +0800\n\nfix: Fixed the issue of ICE integration failure. (#50)\n\n* docs(rtc): 更新WebRTC文档并添加默认STUN服务器配置\n\n1. 修正CONTEXT.md中关于WebRTC ICE配置的描述，替换无STUN的说明为默认使用公共STUN服务器\n2. 在rtc.js中新增DEFAULT_ICE_SERVERS常量，使用Google和Cloudflare的公共STUN服务\n3. 替换两处硬编码的空iceServers配置为默认配置\n\n* feat(rtc): add RTC ICE server management tool and dynamic config support\n\n1. add rtc-tool web UI for managing STUN/TURN servers\n2. add runtime ICE config APIs to RTCManager\n3. add localStorage persistence for custom ICE server config\n4. update docs to reflect new dynamic ICE config capability\n\n* feat(system-info): add NoneOS system info tool page\n\nadd full set of system info page including version check, service worker management and system update functions\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYK/GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgoMQAAHM7SVeHap8YCwav3LdS