7ed45a2cd96feae8b82813","sha":"c2f3736d267665d5a17ed45a2cd96feae8b82813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/c2f3736d267665d5a17ed45a2cd96feae8b82813"}],"sha":"940a2f64beac267b3c2c0e8cf5cb509f77b131a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/940a2f64beac267b3c2c0e8cf5cb509f77b131a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/c2f3736d267665d5a17ed45a2cd96feae8b82813/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:06:48Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:06:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Improve the locale-text component (#49)\n\n* docs: 更新AGENTS.md规范并新增多语言模块文档\n\n1.  修订文件引用规则，补充禁止的file协议类型并新增示例路径\n2.  新增nos/locale-text模块的完整使用文档\n\n* backup\n\n* fix(locale-text): 修复组件数据结构和测试页CDN链接\n\n调整了locale-text组件的返回数据格式，将data改为attrs，同时替换测试文件里的本地CDN路径为完整jsdelivr链接\n\n* feat(locale-text): 新增运行时语言切换能力并完善多语言逻辑\n\n1. 重构语言存储与判定逻辑，新增setLang函数支持运行时切换语言\n2. 优化浏览器语言匹配规则，使用BCP 47主子标签精确匹配\n3. 为locale-text组件添加自动响应语言切换的能力\n4. 完善文档说明与代码安全处理\n\n* Update locale-text.sb.html\n\n* feat: 添加多语言翻译提取工具与中央翻译表支持\n\n新增 locale-text-tool 离线翻译生成工具，完善 locale-text 组件的 JSON 回退能力，添加基础多语言配置文件与文档。\n\n* Update locale-text.html\n\n* refactor(locale-text): 提取fetch缓存逻辑到独立模块并新增测试用例\n\n1. 将locale-text.html内的fetch缓存逻辑抽离到get-locale-text.js模块\n2. 新增fetchLocaleTextJson和resetLocaleTextJsonCache导出函数\n3. 新增4个测试用例覆盖locale-text.json的各种回退场景\n\n* Update main.html\n\n* feat(locale-tool): add detailed views and expand translation coverage\n\nadd complete locale text entries, add file/entry list views for the locale text extraction tool, optimize UI interaction and data processing logic\n\n* feat(locale-text): 实现data-*属性变量替换与自动更新功能\n\n新增{key}到data-key的变量替换能力，支持动态值渲染；添加data属性变更监听实现自动更新，同时为JSON回退场景添加变量替换支持，并新增对应测试用例\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* Update key-manager.html\n\n* refactor(locale-text): 重构getLocaleText，添加变量插值与中央翻译表支持\n\n1.  新增getLocaleText变量插值功能，支持{key}占位符替换\n2.  新增中央翻译表缓存与反向索引，支持运行时加载locale-text.json扩展语种\n3.  更新locale扫描工具，支持提取JS源码中的getLocaleText调用\n4.  新增完整的测试用例覆盖新功能\n\n* docs: 更新 locale-text 文档，补充变量插值与扫描规则\n\n更新了 getLocaleText 的参数说明、回退逻辑与示例，补充了变量插值的优势说明，同时更新了提取工具的扫描文件类型与规则\n\n* docs: 更新多语言文档和翻译条目\n\n详细修改了locale-text的使用文档，补充了动态变量的正确使用方式，并新增了一批多语言翻译条目，包括错误提示、并发控制等场景的国际化文本。\n\n* refactor: 统一多语言文本模板，使用参数化替换\n\n将多处硬编码拼接的多语言文本改为模板变量形式，通过传入参数动态渲染文本内容，提升代码可维护性和多语言适配性\n\n* docs: add locale-text multi-language module docs\n\nadd locale-text module documentation and its entry in SKILL.md, including component usage, API, translation table and extraction tool\n\n* Update locale-text.json\n\n* feat(locale-tool): add orphaned entry management feature\n\n新增冗余条目统计、展示与批量清理功能，补充对应多语言文案和样式美化\n\n* Update index.html\n\n* feat(locale-tool): add orphaned entry cleanup function\n\n1. 从locale文本配置中移除冗余的旧哈希值条目\n2. 新增冗余条目扫描识别与批量清理功能\n3. 增加确认弹窗防止误操作\n4. 更新统计数据与状态提示\n\n* Update main.html\n\n* refactor(locale-text-tool): 替换本地Punch UI依赖为CDN资源\n\n替换了原有的本地Punch UI脚本和组件引用为官方CDN地址，更新了全局样式和组件的CSS变量适配Material Design主题规范\n\n* refactor: 替换旧版Punch UI依赖并统一颜色命名\n\n1. 将本地Punch UI依赖替换为远程CDN版本\n2. 将所有`normal`颜色相关变量统一替换为`neutral`\n3. 调整部分按钮样式参数和变体命名\n\n* refactor(file-list): replace punch-ui menu with custom context menu implementation\n\n- 移除了对外部punch-ui菜单组件的依赖\n- 实现了自定义的右键菜单样式和交互逻辑\n- 将原p-menu-item替换为通用的ctx-menu-item结构\n- 调整了菜单相关的样式和显示逻辑\n- 更新了菜单显隐的操作代码\n\n* refactor: 移动编辑器源码到others/old目录归档旧代码\n\n将nos-tool下的编辑器相关文件全部移动归档到others/old/editor目录下，保留完整历史版本，不再使用nos-tool目录下的旧编辑器代码。\n\n* refactor: 移除旧的文件列表相关组件代码\n\n1. 注释掉create.html中引入的file-list组件\n2. 将nos-tool下的file-list相关文件移动归档到others/old目录下\n\n* Update CONTEXT.md\n\n* docs: update experimental feature warnings for ai and hybrid-data modules\n\nupdate the warning notes in both ai.md and SKILL.md, expand the warning to cover both ai and hybrid-data modules, and refine the warning content to be more accurate\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* chore: 更新版本签名信息并修复locale测试逻辑\n\n1. 更新nos.json中的签名时间和签名值\n2. 修复locale-text测试：临时切换语言测试后恢复原语言设置，避免影响后续测试\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"92f66d6c0f199df8aa616b59cc78ff0d94fe1b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/92f66d6c0f199df8aa616b59cc78ff0d94fe1b7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/c2f3736d267665d5a17ed45a2cd96feae8b82813","verification":{"payload":"tree 92f66d6c0f199df8aa616b59cc78ff0d94fe1b7b\nparent a333c7621224e2aaacd8d769c73551b95cc0842a\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1784707608 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784707608 +0800\n\nfeat: Improve the locale-text component (#49)\n\n* docs: 更新AGENTS.md规范并新增多语言模块文档\n\n1.  修订文件引用规则，补充禁止的file协议类型并新增示例路径\n2.  新增nos/locale-text模块的完整使用文档\n\n* backup\n\n* fix(locale-text): 修复组件数据结构和测试页CDN链接\n\n调整了locale-text组件的返回数据格式，将data改为attrs，同时替换测试文件里的本地CDN路径为完整jsdelivr链接\n\n* feat(locale-text): 新增运行时语言切换能力并完善多语言逻辑\n\n1. 重构语言存储与判定逻辑，新增setLang函数支持运行时切换语言\n2. 优化浏览器语言匹配规则，使用BCP 47主子标签精确匹配\n3. 为locale-text组件添加自动响应语