"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/fb739b63b57db81300aec4e1475718f79a668e00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T07:30:55Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T07:30:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: polish the performance of sw.js (#46)\n\n* Create delete-test-dir.html\n\n* feat(sw): add stale-while-revalidate cache strategy for CDN resources\n\n实现了基于内存TTL的Stale-While-Revalidate缓存策略：\n1.  命中OPFS缓存后立即返回，仅当缓存过期时触发后台刷新\n2.  新增并发请求去重，避免重复回源\n3.  缓存记录随SW进程存活，重启后会自动触发首次刷新\n4.  同步更新了文档说明缓存逻辑\n\n* refactor: 抽离通用CDN处理器，复用github和npm代理逻辑\n\n- 新增cdn-handler.js封装通用CDN缓存逻辑\n- 将github和npm处理器重构为调用通用CDN处理器\n- 更新目录文档和入口注册信息\n- 同步更新了打包产物的代码\n\n* refactor(sw): 优化SW缓存TTL逻辑与离线行为\n\n1. 拆分原有的TTL判断逻辑，细化缓存命中后的处理分支\n2. 新增离线状态守卫，离线时跳过后台刷新避免无效请求\n3. 优化内存Map的条目管理，过期条目下次命中时自动清理回收\n4. 更新文档说明，补充新的缓存处理流程细节\n\n* refactor(sw): 提取SWR缓存逻辑到独立模块，统一缓存策略\n\n- 新增swr-cache.js模块封装SWR缓存核心逻辑，包括内存TTL管理、后台刷新和并发去重\n- 重构cdn-handler.js，移除内部重复的SWR实现，复用新的swr-cache模块\n- 重构ncomp-handle.js，接入统一的SWR缓存逻辑，替换原有本地缓存策略\n- 更新文档和构建产物，同步代码变更\n\n* refactor: 重构CDN资源处理逻辑，合并分散模块到统一处理器\n\n将原github-handler、npm-handler、cdn-handler、swr-cache、ncomp-handle等模块合并为统一的cache-handlers.js，实现gh/npm/ncomp资源的SWR策略复用，简化代码结构并统一缓存管理。\n\n* test(sw-cache): 优化ncomp缓存测试用例\n\n1. 简化缓存测试逻辑，移除元数据校验相关代码\n2. 替换固定延时为轮询等待缓存写入，解决时序抖动问题\n3. 更新测试用例名称以匹配实际测试场景\n4. 新增缓存内容长度的调试输出\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ab203401e8b9a11049bacf13dfe06fb7d349c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/4ab203401e8b9a11049bacf13dfe06fb7d349c65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/fb739b63b57db81300aec4e1475718f79a668e00","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ab203401e8b9a11049bacf13dfe06fb7d349c65\nparent 50dff81d5e13b865271cc0445c53910ded666a34\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1784446255 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784446255 +0800\n\nfeat: polish the performance of sw.js (#46)\n\n* Create delete-test-dir.html\n\n* feat(sw): add stale-while-revalidate cache strategy for CDN resources\n\n实现了基于内存TTL的Stale-While-Revalidate缓存策略：\n1.  命中OPFS缓存后立即返回，仅当缓存过期时触发后台刷新\n2.  新增并发请求去重，避免重复回源\n3.  缓存记录随SW进程存活，重启后会自动触发首次刷新\n4.  同步更新了文档说明缓存逻辑\n\n* refactor: 抽离通用CDN处理器，复用github和npm代理逻辑\n\n- 新增cdn-handler.js封装通用CDN缓存逻辑\n- 将github和npm处理器重构为调用通用CDN处理器\n- 更新目录文档和入口注册信息\n- 同步更新了打包产物的代码\n\n* refactor(sw): 优化SW缓存TTL逻辑与离线行为\n\n1. 拆分原有的TTL判断逻辑，细化缓存命中后的处理分支\n2. 新增离线状态守卫，离线时跳过后台刷新避免无效请求\n3. 优化内存Map的条目管理，过期条目下次命中时自动清理回收\n4. 更新文档说明，补充新的缓存处理流程细节\n\n* refactor(sw): 提取SWR缓存逻辑到独立模块，统一缓存策略\n\n- 新增swr-cache.js模块封装SWR缓存核心逻辑，包括内存TTL管理、后台刷新和并发去重\n- 重构cdn-handler.js，移除内部重复的SWR实现，复用新的swr-cache模块\n- 重构ncomp-handle.js，接入统一的SWR缓存逻辑，替换原有本地缓存策略\n- 更新文档和构建产物，同步代码变更\n\n* refactor: 重构CDN资源处理逻辑，合并分散模块到统一处理器\n\n将原github-handler、npm-handler、cdn-handler、swr-cache、ncomp-handle等模块合并为统一的cache-handlers.js，实现gh/npm/ncomp资源的SWR策略复用，简化代码结构并统一缓存管理。\n\n* test(sw-cache): 优化ncomp缓存测试用例\n\n1. 简化缓存测试逻辑，移除元数据校验相关代码\n2. 替换固定延时为轮询等待缓存写入，解决时序抖动问题\n3. 更新测试用例名称以匹配实际测试场景\n4. 新增缓存内容长度的调试输出\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXH0vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+ekQAHO5sqQuosu2t4owjpzY6Lnf\nyBmLv8Myl13SPyCf+7ojm4ZvOZ2bBhlJhLkz7bP0kiycA5o9AqDbXrAZpHbGq31J\n45Mfg00CW3WS4EIrB8Gaaq1PyIHW334XfuNQ61Rwbe3dROingpo1EiWxHEVYcKoM\nP3bLUQBt2ibnjWdIpeBsQTBkuk4cMUfVf0JKIGUhCAYzh1ZwklDNJA734x4CJVAy\nXXeugCravUTVikfPe06SK41cuAgB2+CzXzkH3wrwOHbksCAD4oOsvLnDfRml0bi0\nGgRYNOMpJXTf2K1E8juYCWDXzK4VE7bCtjP4qLHzuvU6MwuksfTiZTG3mv5WDsmD\n36T+DidM5J4TPw0r9sq0EF0mcLBvVAUs2achjqpdIASgzq4dHRWI38XIxO9w6U5s\nYW/SQoLH4VSpSEh7pIOmXCyhwqPp+VoxG9c+E/s+hwm8ce8WMrEmIGb2JEIwX7ep\n4rtHg0dbQ1ywLbsLIqYMhdyxNT8jcLHXQdiuJMDkPeVWHX4PClGmnLYsI42rn8/L\nOzvsls0L9XwP2+VeAQrxZgahdrp8H/1cezf3Qw3VEh/pPC97M0ZzjXSo8Fg/Ms4z\n6jzc0NkG5LKcJNHLh+3WNqxDf3OeBFgxFMFMM6vdYQD7iwfrP99+D6D/awProiGt\nMr11g/Tp1P4DOU6gZGLv\n=mb+c\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-19T07:30:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"Us