ray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/commits/52b212ff7954c10a344d224c39f826364597d5c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:58:02Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:58:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add network monitoring module (#39)\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* docs: 更新文档内的本地链接为远程可访问链接\n\n将所有相对路径的文档链接替换为GitHub raw格式的永久链接，确保外部访问者可以直接打开对应文档\n\n* docs: add experimental warning notices for AppManager\n\nadd experimental stage warnings to AppManager related code comments and all documentation files, remind users not to rely on it in production environments as APIs may break in future versions\n\n* docs: add verifyData无实例验签文档\n\n补全LocalUser文档中关于verifyData无实例验签的说明，包括使用方法、工作原理、使用场景以及和user.verify的区别\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* feat(server): add auto-reconnect feature and improve connect api\n\n- add setAutoReconnect, disconnect and new connection event support\n- update connect method to support options and backward compatible\n- add intentional disconnect tracking and reconnect task management\n- update docs for new api and auto-reconnect behavior\n\n* docs: update server connection docs with auto-reconnect content\n\n补充服务器连接文档中的自动重连相关API说明和使用示例，新增手动断开连接的文档内容，完善connect方法参数说明。\n\n* chore: build file\n\n* refactor(user, card): 优化远程用户缓存与名片处理逻辑\n\n1. 新增#ensureRemoteUser和_ensureRemoteUser方法统一管理远程用户缓存\n2. 在名片请求/响应处理中自动创建远程用户缓存\n3. 重构消息分发逻辑，统一使用缓存管理方法\n4. 更新文档说明新增的API和事件\n5. 新增测试入口页面整合所有测试用例\n\n* feat(user): add multiple remote user related test cases\n\nAdd 5 new test cases for remote user management:\n1. RemoteUser list and local connected event test\n2. Disconnect user trigger disconnected event test\n3. Connect user failure trigger error event test\n4. Incoming message trigger remote initiated connected event test\n5. isRemoteUserOnline and onlineOnly getRemoteUsers test\n\n* docs: 更新远程用户管理相关文档与打包资源\n\n补充了查看已连接远程用户、断开连接、状态查询和相关事件的文档内容，更新了文档打包压缩包与nos签名信息\n\n* test(connect-user): 更新测试用例的事件参数提取逻辑\n\n将原有的直接取事件对象改为安全访问可选链提取具体字段，优化测试数据的获取方式，避免因事件对象为空导致的取值错误\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* Update nos.json\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"07ab3438f385c08951fcb2c8c5e3cd4e96cfc6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/trees/07ab3438f385c08951fcb2c8c5e3cd4e96cfc6cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/noneos-core/git/commits/52b212ff7954c10a344d224c39f826364597d5c2","verification":{"payload":"tree 07ab3438f385c08951fcb2c8c5e3cd4e96cfc6cb\nparent bc73bc8c6dcf34be0fe502b88f5b184fe41e092b\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1783850282 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783850282 +0800\n\nfeat: Add network monitoring module (#39)\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* docs: 更新文档内的本地链接为远程可访问链接\n\n将所有相对路径的文档链接替换为GitHub raw格式的永久链接，确保外部访问者可以直接打开对应文档\n\n* docs: add experimental warning notices for AppManager\n\nadd experimental stage warnings to AppManager related code comments and all documentation files, remind users not to rely on it in production environments as APIs may break in future versions\n\n* docs: add verifyData无实例验签文档\n\n补全LocalUser文档中关于verifyData无实例验签的说明，包括使用方法、工作原理、使用场景以及和user.verify的区别\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* feat(server): add auto-reconnect feature and improve connect api\n\n- add setAutoReconnect, disconnect and new connection event support\n- update connect method to support options and backward compatible\n- add intentional disconnect tracking and reconnect task management\n- update docs for new api and auto-reconnect behavior\n\n* docs: update server connection docs with auto-reconnect content\n\n补充服务器连接文档中的自动重连相关API说明和使用示例，新增手动断开连接的文档内容，完善connect方法参数说明。\n\n* chore: build file\n\n* refactor(user, card): 优化远程用户缓存与名片处理逻辑\n\n1. 新增#ensureRemoteUser和_ensureRemoteUser方法统一管理远程用户缓存\n2. 在名片请求/响应处理中自动创建远程用户缓存\n3. 重构消息分发逻辑，统一使用缓存管理方法\